WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.634
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:04.167
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.167
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:09.734
President Biden and First Lady
Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:12.367
were photographed yesterday
walking on the beach.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.701
And when there were
one set of footprints,

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:18.901
that's when Jill carried him.

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:21.834
That's right. President Biden
and First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:21.834 --> 00:00:23.534
were photographed
walking on the beach,

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:29.534
while Kevin McCarthy was spotted
walking into the ocean.

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.534
President Biden
and Israeli Prime Minister

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:34.567
Benjamin Netanyahu reportedly
spoke last night on the phone.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.734
Well, if anything can delay
an Israeli ground invasion,

00:00:37.734 --> 00:00:40.467
it's one of Biden's stories.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:42.934
"Let me tell you
about my track and field days.

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:49.067
They called me -- they called me
the Scranton Flier."

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:51.033
Following reports that
he repeatedly

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:54.334
shared sensitive information
with Australian billionaire

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.067
Anthony Pratt,
former President Trump

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:57.968
released a statement
in The New York Times yesterday

00:00:57.968 --> 00:01:01.133
and said Pratt is from
a friendly country in Australia,

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:02.367
one of our great allies,

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:04.133
and added, quote,
"I don't know him well,

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.834
but he seemed like
a nice person."

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:09.801
He seemed like a nice person?

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:11.234
You know, I don't think
it's safe for America

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:13.067
to have a president
who could be kidnapped

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:17.234
with just a puppy
and a van.

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.167
[As Trump] In my defense...

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:21.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.701
What -- What bad people have
a puppy?

00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:29.100
Next thing I know, I'm in a van.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.000
Treated very badly.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.267
[Normally] Senate Minority
Leader Mitch McConnell

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.767
appeared yesterday
on "Face the Nation."

00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:40.167
This was video, by the way.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:43.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.801
That's a clip.

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:50.267
Today marks the House's
third week without a Speaker.

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:52.968
On the plus side, they've
accomplished almost as much as

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:56.501
when they had a Speaker
for three months.

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:58.234
Nine House Republicans
have announced

00:01:58.234 --> 00:01:59.567
plans to run for Speaker,

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:01.567
but if you wanted
to see nine people

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:03.234
who have no chance of winning,

00:02:03.234 --> 00:02:07.067
just go to a Mets game.

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:10.100
Got it in just
under the wire.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:14.200
It's still technically baseball
season, so that's not --

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.767
And you might be saying,
"The Mets have more

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:18.968
than nine people on their team."
Do they?

00:02:21.834 --> 00:02:24.701
After leaving a three-hour-long
closed door meeting last

00:02:24.701 --> 00:02:27.067
Thursday with House Republicans,
Wisconsin Congressman

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:28.634
Mike Gallagher told reporters,
quote,

00:02:28.634 --> 00:02:30.601
"Temperatures are
really high in there."

00:02:30.601 --> 00:02:34.000
Well, that's what happens when
only half of them are vaxed.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:40.767
That -- I do want to stress,
that's exactly --

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:44.934
that's exactly how
I thought that would go.

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:48.701
Don't think you caught me
off guard.

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.067
The remaining games
of a youth football season

00:02:51.067 --> 00:02:52.634
in Tennessee
were canceled recently

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:55.200
after parents of opposing teams
got into a fight

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.000
and one man allegedly
brandished a gun.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.000
While in Texas,

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.367
that's just
a five-yard penalty.

00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:07.000
Today was national
TV Talk Show Host Day.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.701
My writers passed around a card,

00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:10.334
but it was for Kimmel.

00:03:13.734 --> 00:03:15.801
Long Island railroad workers
in New York

00:03:15.801 --> 00:03:17.501
recently returned
a lost backpack

00:03:17.501 --> 00:03:21.234
with $12,000 to its owner
after she left it onto a train.

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:24.334
Even more surprising,
the woman had $12,000

00:03:24.334 --> 00:03:27.200
and still took
the Long Island Railroad.

00:03:29.801 --> 00:03:32.801
And finally, Amazon announced
plans last week to begin testing

00:03:32.801 --> 00:03:36.133
a humanoid robot called Digit,
which has arms and legs

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:38.801
and can move, grasp,
and handle items like a person,

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:41.934
and most important of all,
no bladder.

00:03:47.901 --> 00:03:53.701
And we've maybe miscalculated
what our closer was.

00:03:53.701 --> 00:03:56.934
But we can't go back in time.

00:03:56.934 --> 00:04:00.968
So I will simply say
that was a monologue, everybody.

